      "side": 1,
      "message": "We don\u0027t need a fourth atomic for this.\n\nglobal / state / temp already give the same information. A dedicated total only adds a hot-path inc/dec on every insert_fd_lru/remove_fd_lru and a new invariant (total \u003d\u003d global + state + temp) that can fail on its own.\nD-Bus/gRPC reporting is not a hot path. If a total is needed, sum the three counters at report time:\n  open \u003d global + state + temp;",
